{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36624","headline":"郑州献卢舍人 · 罗隐","name":"郑州献卢舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海槎闲暇阆风轻，不是安流不肯行。\n鸡省露浓汤饼熟，凤池烟暖诏书成。\n渔筹已合光儒梦，尧印何妨且治兵。\n会将两都收复後，右图仪表左题名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}